{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>And Moses was not able to enter the Tent of Meeting.</b> But another verse says: ״וּבְבֹא מֹשֶׁה אֶל אֹהֶל מוֹעֵד״ (Numbers 7)? A third verse came and decided between them — ״כִּי שָׁכַן עָלָיו הֶעָנָן״: say, from now on, all the time that the cloud was upon him he could not enter; once the cloud lifted, he entered and spoke with Him (Sifra)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:56:57.084490217Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}